WEBVTT

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.340
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.850
I don't dislike girls with dark skin.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.690
And I like you too, Adachi.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:06.610
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:10.550
See? I'm totally darker
than you, Toji, aren't I?

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:13.220
Uh, mm-hmm. But still, I-

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:17.560
I heard that you didn't like girls
who had darker skin, Toji!

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:18.860
That if you were going
to choose a girlfriend,

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:21.560
you'd rather have someone
with lighter skin than yours!

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:23.720
That's what I heard...

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.570
Sorry.

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:30.900
I really don't remember ever saying that.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.570
But if you have been anxious
all this time because of that, Adachi,

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:36.240
then I really do feel bad about it.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:38.240
I'm sorry.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.540
It's true,

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:42.910
I don't much like those girls who go
to tanning salons to tan themselves,

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.850
but you're another story, Adachi.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.250
Really?

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:51.220
I'm really good enough for you?

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.610
Don't forget about me being here!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:19.620
"'Trap Kiss!"'

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.950
After l woke up the next morning,

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:25.090
l was beside myself with anxiety,

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:27.120
wondering if what had
happened yesterday was just a dream.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:32.630
After all, it didn't feel real.
l thought that Toji was so impenetrable,

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:35.660
l never would have thought that
he would declare his love for me.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:40.640
l was so concerned over
my dark skin up until yesterday,

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:43.640
and yet starting today,
l don't have to worry about it.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.980
Momo-chan!

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:49.910
Thank you for yesterday!
You saved me again!

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:54.320
I should have just let you sink yesterday!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.390
Are you sure you weren't really the one

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:58.990
who did artificial respiration
on me two years ago, Momo-chan?

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:04.260
I mean, Misao-chan said that it was done
so well, she doubted it was your first time.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.770
I had a course in it because I was
on the swim team a long time ago,

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.930
so I just knew how, that's all!

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.600
And what do you think you're doing?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.940
Marking! Now, you belong
to me, Momo-chan.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.280
Get off of me, you idiot!

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.940
We made love!

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.810
Cut it out!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.010
She's mine.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:34.290
Oh, my! What, you two wound up together?

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:38.300
That we have. Don't ever put
any moves on Adachi again.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.030
Oh...

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.500
If he ever does anything
to you again, let me...

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.810
If anything ever happens, let me know.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:57.840
lt wasn't a dream! l... l really
have become Toji's girlfriend!

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.250
Hey, what is it with that girl?

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:04.590
Now she's with another boy?
That's pretty low. She moves fast, huh?

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:07.460
I knew she was just
playing around with Kairi.

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:15.600
You want to keep it a secret
that we're seeing each other? Why?

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:21.610
Well... you know how those crazy rumors
about me and Okayasu are going around?

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:25.940
If it gets out that I'm seeing you so soon,
Toji, there's no telling what they'll say.

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.950
There was nothing
between you and him, right?

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:29.950
O- of course not! Nothing!

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:32.280
Then we can be open about it, can't we?

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:34.620
Um... but...

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.690
Toji, I don't want you to be uncomfortable

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:39.630
about any of the fuss that
might get raised around me.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:41.960
Well, if you say so, Adachi.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:44.630
And you especially have
to keep it a secret from Sae!

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.300
Why?

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:50.970
You know, "'In order to trick your enemies,
begin with your allies,"' right?

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.310
That is full-on cute!

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:54.970
Where did you find it?

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:57.980
Kashiwagi-san, you really
do have great taste!

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:59.310
Do I?

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:04.580
Sae's at it again! That's the one
l said I liked the other day.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.250
Hey, Sae-chan!

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.510
What?

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:14.930
Keeping my going out with Toji
a secret was the right call.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.600
lf Sae ever finds out, you can
bet she'll try breaking us up.

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:21.730
It's true. Others are saying it, too.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:24.600
You're the number-one
girl in class, Sae-chan.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:26.610
Oh, I don't know...

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:30.610
Oh, how can Kairi be as cute as he is!?

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:34.610
You know what? You know what?
I like Tojigamori-kun from 3rd Class.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:36.280
Oh, he's fine, too!

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.280
Isn't he?

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:41.450
I'd sure like to have them on either arm!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:48.190
Um... This movie is playing
until this Sunday. If you like...

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:55.300
Check a mirror and guess again,
you Cro-Magnon!

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:57.300
Cro-Magnon?

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:01.030
Why!? Why is that
dark-skinned girl so popular!?

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:04.770
l'm the number-one girl on campus!

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:09.920
You're so quiet.

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.580
Huh? I am?

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:15.590
Yes, you are. You act a lot
more powerful when Okayasu is around.

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:17.260
Oh, that's just...

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:20.290
I've never dated anyone before.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.930
I don't know what I should talk
about at times like this.

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:26.600
Or should l say, just by being
in front of Toji like this,

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:29.270
my heart feels like it's going to burst.

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:31.870
Well, tell me about yourself, Adachi.

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:35.270
Like what's your favorite food,
or what were you like as a child?

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.610
I'll tell you about me, too.

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:39.100
Toji...

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:45.820
l really do like him! l love him!
Ah, is it okay for me to be this happy?

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:53.290
Huh? You need to talk?

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:56.630
Mm-hmm, there's just something
that's worrying me right now...

00:07:56.630 --> 00:08:00.570
Uh... can't we do it tomorrow?

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:03.900
l'm supposed to meet Toji at the bookstore.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:06.060
Just ten minutes! {lease!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:12.240
It's about this boy I'm seeing right now.

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:14.580
Sae, you're seeing someone?

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:17.780
What's her deal? As much as
she wants to hear about others,

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.920
she's this secretive about herself?

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:22.590
I've only been seeing him for a week now.

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:25.920
Yesterday, I went over to his house,
but no one else was home,

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.890
and sure enough, just as
I was thinking to myself "'yikes!"'

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:31.260
he came this close to kissing me!

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:34.370
I desperately fought back,
and managed to get away safely,

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.600
but it was quite a close call, you know?

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:40.070
Hang on! What is it with that guy?
He's moving too fast!

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:41.940
Sae, are you sure he's not toying with you?

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.280
Maybe.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:46.950
Well, he tried to kiss you after you've
only been together a week, right?

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.280
Who exactly is this guy?

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.810
He's someone you know well, Momo-chan.

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:56.620
He turned you down once, and yet
you're still going out with that guy!?

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:59.960
He's toying with you!
He's definitely toying with you!

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:01.890
Momo-chan, who are you talking about?

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:05.560
Okayasu, right? Okayasu Kairi!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:08.690
No! It's Toji! Tojigamori-kun!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.570
So, what do you think I should do?

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:17.030
If he comes after me again, I think
he's going to get all the way through.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.810
Momo-chan!?

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:26.750
Toji and Sae? Toji?

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.620
lt's not true! lt's not true!
lt's not true! No way, l don't believe it!

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:37.860
Adachi, over here!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.270
Hmm? What?

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.330
He's the same Toji as always.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:50.940
lf he were hiding something,
he wouldn't be so acting so calm, huh?

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:54.780
Okayasu maybe, but Toji isn't
that kind of wild animal, right?

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:55.950
And it is Sae we're talking about.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:59.710
She might have caught on to my feelings,
and just made it all up.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:04.080
Would you pay? I'll go get us a table.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:08.150
That will be ¥680.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:15.970
H- hold on a minute...
That's what Sae was wearing yesterday!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.130
Why does Toji have it?

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.640
Miss?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.040
Huh? Haven't you paid yet?

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.980
I... have to go!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.540
Hang on! Adachi!

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:04.280
lt's not like l believed
what Sae had told me...

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.820
but if Toji was carrying this,

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:10.960
it means that he and Sae did
see each other that same day.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:14.290
Yesterday, I went over to his house,
but no one else was home,

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:15.860
and sure enough, just as I was
thinking to myself "'yikes!"'

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:18.560
he came this close to kissing me!

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.970
Adachi...

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:24.160
Listen, about yesterday...

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:35.340
Did you and Momo-chan get
into a fight or something?

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:41.590
It's no use. I can't bear to face Toji.

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:45.660
Momo-chan!

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:47.660
W- where did you come from!?

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:52.330
Well? Are you and Toji getting along
all right? Still, you should watch out.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:55.270
Those guys that look
all straitlaced on the outside

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.830
can actually be all brooding and pervy.

00:12:01.270 --> 00:12:03.300
M- Momo-chan?

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:14.950
Oh, so Adachi did tell you
about us, Kashiwagi.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:18.290
That's right! So don't worry,
you can tell me anything.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.630
The thing is, I don't understand it.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:24.630
Why did Adachi suddenly
start behaving like that?

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:27.630
It sounds like Momo-chan is apprehensive.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:31.640
Remember, Toji, you saw her performing
mouth-to-mouth on Okayasu-kun,

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:32.640
didn't you?

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:36.980
She's concerned that she might
have hurt you by doing that, Toji.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:41.650
That's crazy. If she hadn't done that
when she did, he might have died.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:45.980
I'll tell Adachi that I'm not bothered
by it, and that she should relax.

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:48.650
No! No! That will have the opposite effect!

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:53.660
Saying "'It doesn't bother me"' is as good
as saying that you are bothered!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.660
Then, what should I do?

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:58.330
When something like this happens...

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:02.270
...you should just kiss her
without saying anything.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:06.940
If you kiss her, Toji, then all of
her anxiety will just fly away like that!

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:08.610
B- but I've never...

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.110
Oh, please,

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.740
it's not as though this is the first time
you've ever kissed someone, right?

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:19.350
Huh!? You've never kissed anyone!?

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:20.950
When I was in middle school,

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:24.290
I was always playing baseball,
and never had time for girls.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.020
H- how adorable!

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:32.860
Look, how about
if I let you practice on me?

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:35.300
No, I couldn't!

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:37.640
Well, if you don't,
then when the time really comes,

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.300
you won't be able to do anything!

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:42.310
It's okay, it's okay,
this is all for Momo-chan's sake.

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:43.640
I said no!

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:45.310
Come on, just hush!

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:47.480
W- what's the matter, Momo-chan?

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:49.310
Did something happen
between you and Toji?

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:51.320
Stop bothering me! Leave me alone!

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:54.320
Momo-chan... Hey, Momo-chan...

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:55.990
l have to ask Toji to make sure.

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:58.480
Just crying isn't going
to do anything for me.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:15.270
Say, that's Toji and Sae-chan...
isn't it, isn't it?

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:18.240
Whoo! Caught in the act cheating on you!

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:22.770
Momo-chan?

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:38.100
Wow, you know, Toji sure
is doing a number, huh?

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.630
One minute he's saying
"'Momo-chan is mine,"'

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:43.070
the next minute, he's not at all bashful
about putting the moves on Sae-chan.

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:45.640
Surprise, surprise.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:48.730
Momo-chan, under the circumstances,
how about switching over to me-

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:54.980
Hold on a sec! I'm not
the one you want to hit!

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.570
He said he liked me!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:10.600
Why!? Why would he kiss another girl!?
And Sae, of all people!?

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:13.530
What did his declaration
of love even mean?

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:30.280
I'm sorry...

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.010
...for taking it out on you.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:38.290
Why do you do that!?

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:42.290
Oh, my, it's just that you're
so cute when you cry, Momo-chan.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.960
You dope! You moron!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:48.630
Still, this puts you on the
same footing as Toji. You're even now.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:49.970
How so!?

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:52.970
Momo-chan, you kissed me, didn't you?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:56.980
That was something you stole
from me without asking!

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:59.980
That's it... That kiss just now...

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:02.250
Sae...

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:07.050
Sae took it by force! Toji didn't want
to do it, but she forced herself on him!

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:08.250
Or took him by surprise!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:11.260
How is it that you can construe it
to suit you so easily?

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:16.430
That's definitely it! It has to be!
After all, Toji isn't that kind of guy!

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:19.300
Momo-chan, a man's
sense of reason crumbles

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:23.600
like a fragile sand castle
in the face of his instinct.

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:27.770
Your dear Toji is no exception.
It's the design of nature.

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:31.470
Toji is not an animal, like you are!

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.350
I don't think he is...

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:42.080
"'Study Hall
Turn in handouts"'

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:46.620
Hold on, are those two going out,
by any chance?

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:50.300
Wow, that's a shock. And here
I was going after Tojigamori.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:53.970
Not true! I'm Toji's girlfriend!

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:59.540
Sae doesn't think l can speak out.
But Toji is Toji!

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:03.060
Doesn't he have any sense of guilt,
or a conscience?

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:06.580
Ah, l shouldn't have told him
l wanted to keep it a secret

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:08.070
about us seeing each other.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.350
Good! Good! That's it!

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:18.260
You've got to play it casually,
like nothing's bothering you.

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:19.780
Toji?

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:24.600
She figured it out!
Sure enough, Sae figured it out!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:29.330
Oh, so that's it. l get it.
That means her next target is Toji, huh?

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:34.310
Geez, Momo-chan, you look so stern.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:37.280
Okayasu-kun won't like you anymore
if you make that face.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:40.610
You've figured it out, haven't you?

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:42.850
That Toji is the one I'm really after.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:45.950
That he's declared his love for me,
and that we're seeing each other now.

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:48.620
So don't go near Toji anymore.

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:52.720
That can't be right!
After all, we're lovey-dovey!

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:55.960
Just today, I got kissed
by him in the back courtyard.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:18:03.570
I know. I was watching. But it looked
to me like you forced the kiss on him, Sae.

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:05.700
Yes! That got a rise out of her!

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:12.480
My goodness, what's a girl to do?

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:16.580
I wonder if that's how badly
Toji wanted to get kissed.

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:18.580
I thought it was strange, you know?

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:22.920
You might say that he's been quite
mindful of you for a while, Momo-chan.

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:26.930
You told Okayasu that you liked Toji
ever since middle school, right?

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:30.660
Toji and I were right there
in the back courtyard when it happened.

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:36.270
But who would have thought that he would
declare his love for you the next day?

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:39.470
Man, that Toji! I wonder if he
thought that with you, Momo-chan,

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.940
he could get a kiss right away.

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:46.340
I'm sorry, Momo-chan. I'll give Toji
a good chewing-out for it later.

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:59.410
I wonder if he thought that with you,
Momo-chan, he could get a kiss right away.

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:03.360
No! Toji is not that kind of person!

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:13.690
After class, wait for me poolside.
I need to tell you something.

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:19.040
After school... poolside...

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:24.250
Toji!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:27.250
Momo-chan said she wanted
to meet you in the cafeteria.

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:29.590
I'll bet she doesn't want to tan
while waiting outside, you know?

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:31.590
Oh, okay.

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:33.150
Good luck.

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:44.760
He's taking a long time. He should
have finished cleaning a while ago.

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:49.940
Guess who!

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:51.140
Toji!

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:55.840
"'Cafeteria"'

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:05.620
Toji sure is taking his time.
He really told you to wait out here?

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:08.630
He did. What are you doing here?

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:13.300
I just had a feeling that if
I came here, I'd see you, Momo-chan.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:15.630
How long are you planning to stay here?

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:19.730
Well, if I left, you'd be here worrying
all by yourself, right Momo-chan?

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:23.140
I don't care what you say,
he's taking too long.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:26.310
Why don't you go check
his shoe locker for his shoes?

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:31.300
That's okay. Toji asked me to wait here,
and I'm going to wait until he comes.

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:43.390
Momo-chan, how about you give up on Toji,
and seriously start going out with me?

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:49.000
What's so great about me?

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:52.340
Why, your promising broad shoulders,
of course!

00:20:52.340 --> 00:20:54.010
Well, excuse me!

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:56.170
I was just joking around!

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:59.340
It's your wholeheartedness.

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:03.280
Then, you wouldn't mind
if I still liked Toji, right?

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.620
Hold on, now! Forget I said anything!

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.620
I cannot accept any alterations!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.960
You're kidding.
Momo-chan hasn't come yet?

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:15.050
And here I thought you'd be getting along
all right by now, so I came by to see.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.090
Don't tell me Momo-chan is...

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:26.970
What is she doing with him?

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.310
I was afraid of this.

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.980
You were afraid of this?
Of what, Kashiwagi?

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:33.310
Momo-chan said something to me today.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:36.650
She said that now that she was seeing Toji,
he was duller than she expected,

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:40.320
and that it was a lot more
fun being with Okayasu-kun.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.550
Ah, Toji!

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:46.820
Toji!

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:48.920
Toji!

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.660
Hey, hold on, Toji!

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.000
Don't pull me so hard! My hand!

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:02.940
This is where Toji and Sae were kissing...

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:05.270
Oh, no... Why would he bring me here?

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:09.610
He wouldn't...

00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:13.070
I wonder if he thought that with you,
Momo-chan, he could get a kiss right away.

00:22:18.620 --> 00:22:19.890
No!

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:26.930
Toji...

00:22:36.560 --> 00:22:42.900
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:42.900 --> 00:22:52.580
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:55.580
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.580 --> 00:23:02.190
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:08.530
Where can we go

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:18.200
where we can all be

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:20.870
under the same sky?

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:29.210
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.210 --> 00:23:35.890
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:42.230
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:49.430
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.430 --> 00:23:57.100
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.510 --> 00:24:06.520
What do l do? Momo-chan is mad at me.
She found out that l kissed Toji.

00:24:06.520 --> 00:24:10.190
Although, Toji's lips are softer
than l thought they'd be, you know?

00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:14.420
Next time on {each Girl,
"'You'd Go That Far!? Super Sae"'
